== Walkthrough ==

* Note: This quest made MQable on the 2/13/13 patch.

Your Location is -1409.67, 547.72, -49.54

* '''Even though Xelha doesn't talk to you at dubious, or apprehensive, she will accept the [[Bone Chips]].''' She WILL NOT accept fire beetle eyes or spiderling silk until faction is more suitable (Xelha is [[Dismal Rage]]).

You say, 'Hail, Xelha Nevagon'

: [[Xelha Nevagon]] says 'A new recruit to our cause. Just what I have been waiting for! How would you like to serve the great Xelha Nevagon? I need an apprentice necromancer to [assist the great Xelha].'

You say, 'I will assist the great Xelha.'

: Xelha Nevagon says 'Oh look..a talking lump of refuse..how novel!'

'''Give her 4 x [[Bone Chips]]. (Can be stacked and can be multiple turn-ins as long as its in multiples of 4)''' 

: Xelha Nevagon says 'Excellent work! You are quite the little helper. Here you go, then. A little something for your little work. Your service to me has caused Innoruuk to look upon you favorably. Your faith in our group has grown. Continue the work.'
<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Dismal Rage]] got better. (+5)
* Your faction standing with [[Knights of Truth]] got worse. (-1)
* Your faction standing with [[Opal Dark Briar]] got better. (+5)
</div>
{{Exp}}

You receive 1 gold from Xelha Nevagon.

'''Experience from Turn-ins''':

* 10%-11% xp at Level 2 (Troll Shaman Innoruuk)
* 4% at Level 3 (Troll Shaman Innoruuk)
* 2.15% at level 4 (Ogre Shadow Knight)
* 1.1% at level 5 (Ogre Shadow Knight)



* At amiable to Dismal Rage, Xelha would talk to me and accept both fire beetle eyes and spiderling silk. I did not try at indifferent.

* edit : At indifferent, she actually offer the 3 quest. you can start with fire beetle and silk.
* edit : I can confirm she offered the 3 quests but did not accept fire beetle and silk until amiable.

You say, 'I will assist the great Xelha.'

: Xelha Nevagon says 'Fantastic. Stick with me and you shall ascend in our ranks quickly. I am in need of some components for new spells. Will you collect them for me? I shall need four each of the following - fire beetle eyes, bone chips and spiderling silk. Fetch these items for me at once. Well..? Did not you hear the great Xelha? Begone!'

'''Give her 4 x [[Fire Beetle Eye]].'''

: Xelha Nevagon says 'This is a good sight. I needed these to complete the current mixture.
Bah!! I shall reward you for this small, very small, deed!! I pass on to you the knowledge of summoning. The more you serve, the more your faith in Innoruuk grows.'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Dismal Rage]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Knights of Truth]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Opal Dark Briar]] got better.
</div>
{{Exp}}

You receive 5 silver from Xelha Nevagon.

You receive either '''Spell: Cavorting Bones''' or '''Spell: Reclaim Energy'''.

'''Give her 4 x [[Spiderling Silk]].'''

: Xelha Nevagon says 'Let's see here. One.. two.. three.. and.. four. Great!! Just enough for my needs. You are serving Xelha well. I give you Xelha's Sparkler. It is not much, but neither are you. You know what I really need is a cyclops eye. That would be worthy of a great reward.'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Dismal Rage]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Knights of Truth]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Opal Dark Briar]] got better.
</div>
{{exp}}

You receive 3 silver from Xelha Nevagon.

You receive {{:Xelha's Sparkler}}

